Applies to: src/etl/generic_loader.py (port of pipelines/cypher/ifc2neo4j/ifc_to_graph.py)
and prompts.GENERIC_SCHEMA in src/agent/prompts.py (the "Neo4j graph schema and essentials"
section of pipelines/cypher/system_prompt.jinja2), from the companion code of

  C. Du, S. Hellin, S. Fuchs, A. Borrmann, "Querying BIM Models with LLM Agents: A Comparison
  of Data Representations", ECPPM 2026. doi:10.5281/zenodo.22679659 (repository commit 85eaf24).

Their importer is in turn adapted from ConMan2 (https://github.com/seb-esser/ConMan2,
Sebastian Esser et al., TUM; MIT): S. Esser, S. Vilgertshofer, A. Borrmann, "Graph-based
version control for asynchronous BIM collaboration", Advanced Engineering Informatics 53 (2022)
101664, doi:10.1016/j.aei.2022.101664.

